{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1060694/block/singleImage/3250742/wm/01M3HK9A610B4QDYN2H33XC9FR.JPG?updatedAt=1793177378\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀美麗華廣場女子墮樓，昏迷送院搶救。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (28 日 ) 上午 9 時 53 分，警方接獲途人報案，指發現一名女子，倒臥尖沙咀彌敦道 132 號美麗華廣場地下位置，懷疑她從高處墮下。 救援人員接報到場，該名46歲姓韓事主重傷昏迷不醒，由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。警方於現場檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。消息指，事主在美麗華廣場一期三樓平台餐廳墮下， 生前受家庭問題困擾不開心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:37.768523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:06:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.953923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:19:00.228108+00:00","content_hash":"5c1c4ec488c70698f26ca3961d32f27a7685de377b71d1d664d7991550d036c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:37.768523+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}